<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"Noto Sans SC","Source Han Sans SC","PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 120, padding: '34px 64px 0', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>初衷落到工程：四条验收级的设计原则</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 8 }}>全部摘自架构文档原文——每一条都能落到具体机制上验收</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 540, padding: '20px 64px 0', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 316, background: '#EFF6FF', border: '1px solid #BFDBFE', borderRadius: 14, padding: '26px 24px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#2563EB', letterSpacing: 3, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>PRINCIPLES</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 12 }}>我的初衷不是<br />用 AI 炫技</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 5, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #2563EB 0%, #06B6D4 100%)', borderRadius: 3, margin: '16px 0 16px' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.65, flex: 1 }}>是想让工厂里那些散落在系统、表格和电话里的知识，第一次变得可问、可查、可审计。所以每一条原则都必须能验收——说不出验收方式的口号，不进设计。</Text>
            <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #BFDBFE', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 14px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E40AF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>可验收的初衷，<br />才是真初衷。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 12, padding: '0 20px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace', width: 56 }}>01</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>数据质量优先于智能能力</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 3 }}>数字一律来自 SQL 溯源；缺测量数据标 data_gap 并强制人工确认——缺数据也要人拍板，不编一个结论。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 12, padding: '0 20px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace', width: 56 }}>02</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>私有化部署，数据不出厂</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 3 }}>全栈本地可跑：LLM 提供方可插拔（Ollama / 任意 OpenAI 兼容网关），全部留空即进入离线降级模式，链路依然完整。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 12, padding: '0 20px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace', width: 56 }}>03</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>关键决策人在环路（HITL）</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 3 }}>会签一人一签、并发幂等；Agent 身份只允许 *.propose，持有 *.approve 直接启动失败——机器可以提案，不能批准。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 12, padding: '0 20px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace', width: 56 }}>04</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>统计量代码计算，LLM 只做解读</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 3 }}>CPK / Pp / Ppk / 柏拉图由纯函数计算、不经过 LLM；LLM 不可用时结论用模板并显式标注 degraded——质量判异不信口。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 64px', position: 'relative' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 12, height: 12, borderRadius: 3, background: '#2563EB' }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 9, height: 9, borderRadius: 5, background: '#06B6D4' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>mfg-agent-platform · 独立开发实践分享</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>06 / 20</Text>
        <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 3, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #2563EB 0%, #06B6D4 55%, rgba(6,182,212,0) 100%)' }} />
    </Box>
</Slide>
